msgid "Enter the address of Uptime Kuma with an API key (or the public status pages to read), read now, then follow up the services down, the certificates that expire soon and the exposed assets without a monitor. A long outage can be turned into a security incident with one click, then announced to the users with the crisis communication; nothing is created automatically and nothing is changed in Uptime Kuma."
msgstr "Enter the address of Uptime Kuma with an API key (or the public status pages to read), read now, then follow up the services down, the certificates that expire soon and the exposed assets without a monitor. A long outage can be turned into a security incident with one click, then announced to the users with the crisis communication; nothing is created automatically and nothing is changed in Uptime Kuma."

